{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NET.CRAWL</strong> is a deck-building roguelike played on a hexagonal grid. Moving into a hex(node) activates it and triggers its effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/ba7b612ffa3f8621652522181c15a726.poster.avif?t=1756467035\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/ba7b612ffa3f8621652522181c15a726.webm?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/ba7b612ffa3f8621652522181c15a726.mp4?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue nodes give you Data. Yellow nodes - Credits.<br>Green nodes are your personal toolbox, with effects ranging from basic defense to creative rule bending.<br>Red nodes are hostile. They will cause you all sorts of trouble. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/efcc9ef7a9b8168218a50ba37fb99cf9.poster.avif?t=1756467035\" width=620 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/efcc9ef7a9b8168218a50ba37fb99cf9.webm?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/efcc9ef7a9b8168218a50ba37fb99cf9.mp4?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there are the purple ones. <strong>The Cores.</strong> Mini-bosses, each with its own unique ability or victory condition. They are very powerful, almost game-breaking. You won't be able to defeat them without a tailored strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/801fb830ab930704cab2bf19555afc70.poster.avif?t=1756467035\" width=620 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/801fb830ab930704cab2bf19555afc70.webm?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/801fb830ab930704cab2bf19555afc70.mp4?t=1756467035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nodes of all the types are mixed together to create levels with endless opportunities for combos and synergies. And since this is a deckbuilder - you get to pick those nodes yourself!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2958140?t=1756467035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756467035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/eed765ecb468412247d7ce7c645f410eefe52520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756467035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/eed765ecb468412247d7ce7c645f410eefe52520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756467035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3502200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NET.CRAWL</strong> is a deck-building roguelike played on a hexagonal grid. Moving into a hex(node) activates it and triggers its effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video